1
00:00:00,653 --> 00:00:04,453
Hey, statistically speaking, I'm sure
you have something to worry about.

2
00:00:05,658 --> 00:00:06,718
(Leonard:)What do you mean?

3
00:00:06,893 --> 00:00:10,953
(Sheldon:)Well, if we assume
that your looks are average...

4
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:14,790
...right off the bat, 50 percent of men on
Earth are more attractive than you.

5
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:22,900
That's 1.5 billion handsome lads
standing by, waiting to rain on your parade.

6
00:00:24,877 --> 00:00:27,177
(Leonard:)Well, yeah, but this isn't just about looks.

7
00:00:27,346 --> 00:00:30,246
(Leonard:)I'm way above average
in a lot of other things.

8
00:00:30,416 --> 00:00:35,856
(Sheldon:)Not height, vision, athleticism,
or ability to digest dairy products.

9
00:00:36,856 --> 00:00:40,556
(Leonard:)I'm talking about important things
like emotional maturity.

10
00:00:40,726 --> 00:00:44,426
(Sheldon:)You were just spying on your girlfriend
through a peephole.

11
00:00:45,665 --> 00:00:48,605
(Leonard:)I liked it better
when you thought I wasn't here.

12
00:00:48,801 --> 00:00:51,501
(Sheldon:)I'm not saying
you don't have attractive qualities.

13
00:00:51,671 --> 00:00:54,231
(Sheldon:)Your choice of friends is impeccable.

14
00:00:54,407 --> 00:00:55,837
(Sheldon:)You're a good sleeper.

15
00:00:57,009 --> 00:01:03,019
(Sheldon:)And last but not least,
you buy the grapes I like.

